<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to provide for the restitution of certain
coal acquired by the Crown as a result of the operation of the <legref
refid="act-1981-109" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Coal Acquisition Act 1981</i></name></legref> and to provide
for related matters.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


