<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_040a780e-565e-4ccf-b7f9-739af37f2332"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day or days to be
appointed by proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_331367dd-57cd-4cbf-897b-db7cc0141014"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_fd671f86-322a-4b03-9c45-284f65d43693"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_3c76092c-ab60-4e42-974a-d68a34ffd709"
id="def.coal"><b><i>coal</i></b></defterm> has the same meaning as in the
<legref refid="act-1981-109" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Coal Acquisition Act
1981</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_92a2d64f-2ac0-4017-8e85-f27f34007eb2"
id="def.coaltowhichthisActapplies"><b><i>coal to which this Act
applies</i></b></defterm> means coal that:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_59fbdb02-733d-466f-b8dd-f47ba20bd24a" id="sec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was vested in the Crown by the operation of
section 5 of the <legref refid="act-1981-109" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Coal Acquisition Act
1981</i></name></legref>, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_20efc1e1-3fe5-4ddf-ba79-125a6bc0e1c3" id="sec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">on 1 January 1986, was located in land outside a
colliery holding.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_9a5cbe26-a223-49c5-a60c-bef7d5055444"
id="def.collieryholding"><b><i>colliery holding</i></b></defterm> has the same
meaning as in the <legref refid="act-1992-029" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Mining Act
1992</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ad8d439b-3851-48ad-9d67-73f3d6a71e7b"
id="def.CompensationArrangements"><b><i>Compensation
Arrangements</i></b></defterm> means the <legref refid="sl-1985-0236"
jurisd="NSW" type="subordleg" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Coal
Acquisition (Compensation) Arrangements
1985</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_cdb72655-4eaf-443b-9ade-29002b588920"
id="def.CompensationBoard"><b><i>Compensation Board</i></b></defterm> means
the New South Wales Coal Compensation Board established under the Compensation
Arrangements.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_b6b427dc-2816-4395-879a-88628cef6f91"
id="def.eligibleclaimant"><b><i>eligible claimant</i></b></defterm> means a
person who has made a claim for compensation in accordance with the
Compensation Arrangements and whose claim has been allowed by the Compensation
Board, either before or after the commencement of this section, or:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6050eca3-ea51-4e72-bc69-f7b05e7ec24d" id="sec.3-para1.a-oc.2">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if such a person has died&#8212;means the
person&#8217;s legal personal representative, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_82c5c78d-92d4-4008-872f-673cee382556" id="sec.3-para1.b-oc.2">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if such a person is a protected person within the
meaning of the <legref refid="act-2009-049" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>NSW Trustee and Guardian Act
2009</i></name></legref>&#8212;means the manager of the person&#8217;s estate
under that Act, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f9000a9d-20cd-4bd9-9012-d527725791b7" id="sec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if such a person is an insolvent under
administration&#8212;means the trustee in bankruptcy of the person&#8217;s
estate, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_576e3a2c-1d55-492f-8852-d24ba2c63409" id="sec.3-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if such a person is a minor&#8212;means the
minor&#8217;s next friend, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b6fb33dd-de9f-4355-bb48-63262b72c4b1" id="sec.3-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if such a person was a body corporate, whether a
company or not, which has been dissolved and the property of that body is, by
law, vested in a specified person&#8212;means that specified
person.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_19a0a759-2c80-4ef3-9cd3-e381debc6096"
id="def.insolventunderadministration"><b><i>insolvent under
administration</i></b></defterm> means a person who:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_cef695b4-4036-4433-ac4c-800ab52764a4" id="sec.3-para1.a-oc.3">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">under the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Bankruptcy Act
1966</i></name></legref> of the Commonwealth or the law of an external
Territory of the Commonwealth, is a bankrupt in respect of a bankruptcy from
which the person has not been discharged, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_50649b94-d878-4947-80dd-d10f53994193" id="sec.3-para1.b-oc.3">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">under the law of a country other than Australia
or the law of an external Territory of the Commonwealth, has the status of an
undischarged bankrupt,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">and includes:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d0a25b71-c794-4ded-a2ba-adf4ad50fdc5" id="sec.3-para1.c-oc.2">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a person who has executed a deed of arrangement
under Part X of the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Bankruptcy Act 1966</i></name></legref> of the Commonwealth,
or under the corresponding provisions of the law of an external Territory of
the Commonwealth or of the law of a country other than Australia, where the
terms of the deed have not been fully complied with, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1692b9b5-6f4b-459d-9692-0203f2cbe917" id="sec.3-para1.d-oc.2">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a person whose creditors have accepted a
composition under Part X of the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Bankruptcy Act
1966</i></name></legref> of the Commonwealth, or under the corresponding
provisions of the law of an external Territory of the Commonwealth or of the
law of a country other than Australia, where a final payment has not been made
under that composition.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 1992 No 29,
Sch 5; 1997 No 22, Sch 2 [1]; 2001 No 112, Sch 1.5 [1]; 2009 No 49, Sch
2.10.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ecf2b5d8-6ba8-474f-bd90-72c504c19f07"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_350211fd-8d9e-45a3-aaba-c27e341bbeb0"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Power of the Minister to grant coal in accordance with this
Act</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fc5a415d-59c1-44cc-8931-c66651dd57e7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may, in accordance with this Act,
grant to eligible claimants coal to which this Act
applies.</txt></block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1d2a542a-74e7-4949-b132-0913b79b39b2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may exercise the power conferred by
this section only on the recommendation of the Compensation
Board.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_be426f1a-b899-4fe1-906f-8115424f5b83"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Coal granted under this Act is to be granted for
an estate in fee simple.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a281cb13-0c8a-4df3-bccc-6f3b5efef791"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref refid="act-2016-058" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land Management Act
2016</i></name></legref> applies to the disposal of coal under this Act only
to the extent (if any) that the regulations provide.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Am 2017 No 17,
Sch 4.12.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7637e696-f4d6-4413-b954-ae83d828b65b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_5766838e-4d76-45e9-bdb4-19fa9066d415"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Eligible claimant may apply for restitution of ownership of
coal to which this Act applies</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d5a2ce9b-35d6-43e0-a69f-a2dc4d030cbf"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If coal to which this Act applies was,
immediately before 1 January 1982, owned by an eligible claimant or a person
through whom the claimant claims, the claimant may make an application to the
Compensation Board requesting the Board to make a recommendation to the
Minister that the ownership of the coal be restored to the
claimant.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5d0ab12c-17ec-4e89-be8a-db5caec4937f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An application under this section must:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_045ba85b-b32e-4b38-a1c8-331dc879ba2a" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">be made in the manner and within the period
prescribed by the regulations, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4cab759b-e980-4174-89a4-86b378cd5492" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">contain the information so prescribed,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d745678f-332e-4e7c-b614-cca98a2891d6" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">be accompanied by any documents of a kind so
prescribed.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bf3cd577-0e49-4a81-b222-89da4c9e08d8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">As soon as practicable after such an application
is received by the Compensation Board, the Board must inquire into the
application and make a report of its findings to the Minister, together with a
recommendation as to whether or not the application should be
granted.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bc273995-af69-46dc-8f20-38a24b3a493b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2c94e431-57ce-49e9-b04c-4020ab2cb286" id="sec.5-ssec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">2 or more eligible claimants have received or
would, but for this Act, be entitled to receive compensation under the
Compensation Arrangements for or in respect of the same coal,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c52cf265-43ea-44a2-ab08-3ca6af831793" id="sec.5-ssec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any of those claimants has made an application
under this section,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">the Compensation Board may reject the
application.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6c193987-cfff-48db-ba38-0d2427910fb4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_3332ad60-d5cc-469e-a7d4-a0ae5cf1ef02"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Eligible claimant must refund
compensation</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f7f169e8-bb76-4614-a782-b126e84c5aae"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister must not grant to an eligible
claimant coal to which this Act applies unless the claimant has refunded to
the Compensation Board any amount of compensation paid to the claimant, or a
person through whom the claimant claims, by that Board in respect of the
acquisition of the coal by the Crown under the <legref refid="act-1981-109"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Coal
Acquisition Act 1981</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2" status="repealed">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cf090468-41f3-491a-8cd6-04dbd9abb33d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="status" value="repealed"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>
</tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 6:</b> Am 2001 No 112,
Sch 1.5 [2].</txt></content>
