<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8526a0ce-afa2-4dc7-9308-b331e806e303"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_3b113e46-bd4b-4da8-81d7-755e2fc6a8ae"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Decision of Minister not to be questioned except in limited
circumstances</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5230c356-5b70-4cfd-9c35-f01c91f2b13c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A decision as to whether or not coal should be
granted under this Act is, subject to this Act, in the absolute discretion of
the Minister.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1A">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c11cd8cf-7271-4cbd-8dcf-4e4f5d6fba91"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1A"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1A)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (1):</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0d0058cf-f6d9-45c3-9a53-9f6965596992" id="sec.7-ssec.1A-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">nothing in this Act, or any recommendation under
this Act, requires the Minister to grant coal to eligible claimants,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_cc6461a8-2437-4d4b-980b-ee07645326bf" id="sec.7-ssec.1A-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in particular, the Minister may refuse to grant
coal to an eligible claimant if of the opinion that the Crown would lose
significant revenue were the coal to cease to be vested in the
Crown.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b24dd04b-6570-468f-bcae-5d95ffca100e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A court has no jurisdiction to question a
decision of the Minister, or a recommendation of the Compensation Board, under
this Act, except on the ground of lack of procedural
fairness.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 7:</b> Am 1997 No 22,
Sch 2 [2].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f7e5a7ca-c135-4c10-bcce-8e662e548230"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_23d9efe0-c829-4fd5-974b-244acb6dbbe2"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Power of the Minister to delegate functions under this
Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may, by instrument in writing,
delegate to a specified person or a person holding a specified office any of
the Minister&#8217;s functions under this Act, other than this power of
delegation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_88f07417-ad9c-42a9-86d5-548006e87696"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_74a4ac37-c86b-4f68-a3ee-9a5baa10641f"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_51d176ef-0ed4-417b-83ec-2dfd3b812887"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5868cba1-2dfc-4cba-ba68-d4c240f3d5f8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In particular, the regulations may make provision
for or with respect to the following:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_506a864c-5b70-44e1-9108-4c72de4d42e9" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the information to be provided in applications
under this Act and in documents required to accompany those
applications,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3675f644-7623-4949-9d01-ace0812e4106" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the period within which such applications must be
made,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3a3ed65a-70bd-46e6-8147-31e85e415e7a" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the procedure for determining of such
applications,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_40d439c9-e491-4ad8-9b66-398db070ca43" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the factors to be taken into account in
determining such applications.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


